hello:          ELF 64-bit LSB pie executable, x86-64, version 1 (SYSV), dynamically linked, interpreter /lib64/ld-linux-x86-64.so.2, BuildID[sha1]=<varies>, for GNU/Linux 3.2.0, not stripped
hello-static:   ELF 64-bit LSB executable, x86-64, version 1 (GNU/Linux), statically linked, BuildID[sha1]=<varies>, for GNU/Linux 3.2.0, not stripped
libgreet.so:    ELF 64-bit LSB shared object, x86-64, version 1 (SYSV), dynamically linked, BuildID[sha1]=<varies>, not stripped
hello-stripped: ELF 64-bit LSB pie executable, x86-64, version 1 (SYSV), dynamically linked, interpreter /lib64/ld-linux-x86-64.so.2, BuildID[sha1]=<varies>, for GNU/Linux 3.2.0, stripped
hello-arm64:    ELF 64-bit LSB pie executable, ARM aarch64, version 1 (SYSV), dynamically linked, interpreter /lib/ld-linux-aarch64.so.1, BuildID[sha1]=<varies>, for GNU/Linux 3.7.0, not stripped
$ ./hello
